# Plan Progress Tracker (`docs/plan.md`)

`docs/plan.md` is the single progress tracker for this project. Every agent must keep it current.

## When to update

After completing work that maps to one or more checklist items in `docs/plan.md`:

1. Open `docs/plan.md`.
2. Change every finished item from `- [ ]` to `- [x]`.
3. Include the `docs/plan.md` edit in the same session/PR as the implementation — not as a follow-up.

## Scope of ticking

- Tick only items that are **fully done** per the plan's definition of done (see `CLAUDE.md`).
- If a task partially covers an item, leave it unchecked and note what remains.
- If you intentionally skip or defer an item, do **not** tick it; leave a brief note in the plan or tell the user why.
- Nested checklist items under a parent must be ticked individually when complete.

## Do not

- Mark items complete before the work is verified (build/lint/migration/seed passes where applicable).
- Remove or rewrite plan items without being asked.
- Create a separate progress file — `docs/plan.md` stays authoritative.

## Example

```markdown
- [ ] Run first Prisma migration
```

after migration succeeds:

```markdown
- [x] Run first Prisma migration
```
